330° 15′ 28.2 feet across 20 Foot Roadway;

105° 00′ 158.3 feet along Round Top Forest Reserve;

256° 29′ 41.9 feet along US Military Reservation to the point of beginning.

Area 2,600 Square Feet.

Calvin Coolidge

